          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mitolyn-website.webp\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://709307f1n06vftac084h366rbu.hop.clickbank.net/?&traffic_source=website&extclid=abhi135 \"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/prostavive-574x354.webp\" alt=\"ProstaVive Buy\"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>MITOLYN</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">ProstaVive is an advanced dietary supplement formulated to support prostate health and promote overall well-being in men. Its carefully selected, plant-based ingredients are designed to support healthy urinary function, including comfortable urination and normal urine flow, while also helping men maintain restful sleep and everyday energy as they age. With a natural, thoughtfully developed formula, ProstaVive provides comprehensive nutritional support for maintaining healthy prostate function and long-term wellness.<br><br>ProstaVive features a carefully selected blend of natural ingredients formulated to support healthy urinary function, prostate wellness, and overall male vitality. With regular use, its plant-based formula may help maintain comfortable urinary flow, support a healthy inflammatory response, and promote everyday energy and well-being. ProstaVive is designed for men who want to take a proactive approach to maintaining prostate health and supporting an active, healthy lifestyle as they age.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-black\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"https://709307f1n06vftac084h366rbu.hop.clickbank.net/?&traffic_source=website&extclid=abhi135 \"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-cart-add mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Get Yours At Discount Now&nbsp;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
