          "_name": "team2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"team2\" group=\"Team\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <header condition=\"showSocial\">Social</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"socialCount\" title=\"Count\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"socialIconColor\" value=\"#6592e6\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#cebfaf\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image1-272x305.webp\" alt=\"ProstaVive Buy\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"></h5>\n                            <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>Taurine, a vital amino acid included in VisiSharp, plays a key role in maintaining retinal health and preventing age-related degeneration. It helps regulate hydration levels in eye tissues, effectively reducing dryness, irritation, and discomfortâ€”especially in environments with screen exposure or dry air.</b><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>This nutrient also supports proper visual performance in low-light conditions, enhancing overall eye function and clarity. By promoting cellular stability and protecting retinal cells from oxidative stress, VisiSharpâ€™s taurine contributes to lasting eye wellness and visual comfort.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>To naturally increase taurine levels in your diet, consider adding seafood, turkey, or eggs, which are excellent food sources of this amino acid.</b></div></h6>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Boron (11, 12)</b><br>Boron is a naturally occurring trace mineral that plays a role in several important processes within the body. It is included in ProstaVive™ for its potential to support healthy inflammatory balance, nutrient metabolism, and overall cellular wellness. Boron may also contribute to cognitive and general well-being, making it a valuable addition to a comprehensive men’s wellness formula.<br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image2-272x305.webp\" alt=\" ProstaVive Buy\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"></h5>\n                            <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>Deoxyribonuclease (DNase): </b>This specialized enzyme plays a critical role in breaking down biofilmsâ€”protective layers formed by bacteria and fungi that shield them from treatment. By degrading these biofilms, DNase exposes hidden pathogens trapped within nail crevices or skin folds, enhancing the effectiveness and penetration of antimicrobial agents. This mechanism is particularly beneficial in combating stubborn, chronic infections, enabling deeper cleansing and faster healing of infected areas.</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Tongkat Ali (15, 16, 17)</b><br>Traditionally used in Southeast Asian herbal practices, Tongkat Ali is valued for its role in supporting men’s overall vitality and wellness. It has been studied for its potential to support healthy energy, stress management, and normal male function. Its antioxidant properties may also complement healthy circulation and cellular wellness, making Tongkat Ali a popular ingredient in men’s wellness formulas.<br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>",
