          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#353535\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><b>FDA Compliance<br></b><br>All content and information provided on this page are intended for general informational purposes only and should not be considered medical advice. The information presented is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition. These statements have not been evaluated by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before using any dietary supplement or making changes to your diet, exercise routine, or health regimen. Individual results may vary.<br><br>All trademarks, product names, and trade names displayed on this website belong to their respective owners. Their appearance on this site does not necessarily imply affiliation, sponsorship, or endorsement. If you click on a merchant link and purchase a product or service, we may receive a commission from the merchant at no additional cost to you.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tLwbO91c7M",
          "_anchor": "content5-2r",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".row-links": {
              "width": "100%",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".social-row": {
              "width": "100%",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".media-container-row": {
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              ".foot-menu": {
                "list-style": "none",
                "display": "flex",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "padding": "0",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "padding": "0 1rem 1rem 1rem",
                  "p": {
                    "margin": "0"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".social-list": {
                "width": "auto",
                "padding-left": "0",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                ".mbr-iconfont-social": {
                  "font-size": "1.5rem",
                  "color": "#ffffff"
                },
                ".soc-item": {
                  "margin": "0 .5rem"
                },
                "a": {
                  "margin": "0",
                  "opacity": ".5",
                  "transition": ".2s linear",
                  "&:hover": {
                    "opacity": "1"
                  }
                },
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "-webkit-justify-content": "center",
                  "justify-content": "center"
                }
              },
              ".row-copirayt": {
                "word-break": "break-word",
                "width": "100%",
                "p": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer3\" group=\"Footers\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-reveal': reveal, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"menuItems\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Items\" name=\"socialItems\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reveal effect\" name=\"reveal\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background8.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row align-center mbr-white\">\n            <div class=\"row row-links\" mbr-if=\"menuItems > 0\">\n                <ul class=\"foot-menu\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"menuItems\">\n                    <li mbr-text class=\"foot-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\"foot-menu-item\"><a href=\"privacy-policy.html\" class=\"text-white text-primary\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                    <li mbr-text class=\"foot-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\"foot-menu-item\"><a href=\"disclaimer.html\" class=\"text-white text-primary\">Disclaimer</a></li>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                <li mbr-text class=\"foot-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\"foot-menu-item\"><a href=\"terms-and-conditions.html\" class=\"text-white text-primary\">Terms</a></li></ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row social-row\" mbr-if=\"socialItems > 0\">\n                <div mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"socialItems\" class=\"social-list align-right pb-2\">\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row row-copirayt\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style mbr-white align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".media-container-row .mbr-text\">\n                    Â© Copyright 2025<a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-info text-primary\"> ProstaVive</a>.&nbsp;All Rights Reserved.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tLwQuQyLCE",
          "_anchor": "footer3-2y",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "privacy-policy.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Privacy Policy",
        "order": "1",
        "meta_descr": "Privacy Policy for ProstaVive"
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>\n                    Privacy Policy</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">&nbsp;<br><br>Privacy Policy<br><br>Effective Date: September 2026<br><br>This Privacy Policy explains how ProstaVive (“ProstaVive,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, stores, and protects information when you visit or use the ProstaVive website (the “Site”).<br><br>By accessing or using the Site, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy. We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, legal requirements, or services. When we make changes, we will update the Effective Date shown above. Your continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acknowledgment of the updated Privacy Policy.<br><br>1. Information We Collect<br><br>We may collect information that you voluntarily provide when you use the Site, contact us, subscribe to communications, request information, or purchase products.<br><br>Depending on how you interact with the Site, information may include:<br><br>* Your name<br>* Email address<br>* Mailing or billing address<br>* Telephone number<br>* Order and transaction information<br>* Information you submit through forms or customer-support communications<br>* Other information you voluntarily provide to us<br><br>Payment information may be processed by third-party payment processors. We do not need to directly store your complete credit card information when payment processing is handled by an authorized third-party provider.<br><br>2. Information Collected Automatically<br><br>When you visit the Site, certain information may be collected automatically through your browser, device, or other technologies.<br><br>This information may include:<br><br>* IP address<br>* Browser type and version<br>* Device type<br>* Operating system<br>* Referring website or page<br>* Pages visited<br>* Date and time of visits<br>* General Site usage information<br>* Other technical or analytical information<br><br>We may use this information to operate, maintain, secure, analyze, and improve the Site and to understand how visitors interact with our content.<br><br>3. Cookies and Similar Technologies<br><br>The Site may use cookies, pixels, web beacons, tags, and similar technologies.<br><br>Cookies are small data files stored on your device that can help websites recognize your browser and remember certain information. We may use these technologies to:<br><br>* Remember preferences<br>* Improve Site functionality<br>* Understand Site traffic and usage<br>* Analyze marketing performance<br>* Measure advertising effectiveness<br>* Support remarketing and advertising activities<br>* Improve the overall user experience<br><br>You may be able to control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of portions of the Site.<br><br>Third-party services used on the Site may also use cookies or similar technologies according to their own privacy policies.<br><br>4. How We Use Your Information<br><br>We may use information collected through the Site for purposes including:<br><br>* Providing and improving our products and services<br>* Processing and fulfilling orders<br>* Responding to inquiries and customer-support requests<br>* Communicating with you about orders, products, services, or Site-related matters<br>* Sending marketing or promotional communications where permitted by law<br>* Personalizing your experience<br>* Analyzing Site traffic and user behavior<br>* Measuring advertising and marketing performance<br>* Detecting, preventing, and addressing fraud, abuse, or security issues<br>* Maintaining and improving the security and functionality of the Site<br>* Complying with applicable laws and legal obligations<br><br>If you no longer wish to receive promotional communications from us, you may unsubscribe using the instructions included in the communication or contact us using the information provided below.<br><br>5. Sharing of Information<br><br>We may share information with trusted third parties when reasonably necessary to operate our business and provide the Site, products, and services.<br><br>These parties may include:<br><br>* Payment processors<br>* Website hosting and technology providers<br>* Email and communications providers<br>* Analytics providers<br>* Advertising and marketing service providers<br>* Customer-support providers<br>* Contractors and service providers<br>* Legal, regulatory, or governmental authorities when required or permitted by law<br><br>We expect service providers acting on our behalf to use information only for the purposes for which it was provided and to maintain appropriate safeguards.<br><br>We do not sell your personal information merely because you visit or use the Site. Where applicable law provides you with rights concerning the sharing, sale, or targeted advertising use of personal information, those rights are described in the applicable section below.<br><br>6. Publicly Posted Information<br><br>If you voluntarily provide personal information in a publicly accessible area, such as a comment section, forum, social-media page, or other public platform, that information may be viewed, collected, or used by other individuals.<br><br>We cannot control how third parties may use information that you voluntarily make publicly available. Please exercise caution before posting personal information in publicly accessible areas.<br><br>7. Third-Party Websites and Services<br><br>The Site may contain links to third-party websites, services, products, or platforms.<br><br>We do not control the privacy practices of third-party websites or services. If you follow a link to another website or interact with a third-party service, the privacy policy and terms of that third party will apply to information you provide there.<br><br>We encourage you to review the privacy policy of any third-party website before submitting personal information.<br><br>8. Third-Party Advertising and Analytics<br><br>We may work with third-party advertising, analytics, and technology providers to understand Site traffic, measure advertising performance, and display relevant advertisements.<br><br>These providers may collect information through cookies, pixels, web beacons, or similar technologies.<br><br>Google Analytics<br><br>We may use Google Analytics and related advertising features to analyze how visitors use the Site and to measure marketing performance.<br><br>Depending on the configuration of these services, features may include remarketing, demographic and interest reporting, advertising measurement, and other analytics functions.<br><br>You can manage certain Google advertising and personalization settings through Google's available privacy and advertising controls.<br><br>Third-party providers may maintain their own privacy policies governing their collection and use of information.<br><br>9. Facebook and Other Social Media Platforms<br><br>We may use social-media advertising and tracking technologies, including tools associated with Facebook and other platforms, to measure advertising performance and understand how visitors interact with our Site.<br><br>Information collected through these platforms may be subject to the applicable platform's privacy policy and terms.<br><br>We do not use advertising information obtained from social-media platforms for purposes prohibited by the applicable platform's policies.<br><br>Where required, we will obtain applicable permissions or provide appropriate notices regarding the use of tracking and advertising technologies.<br><br>10. Business Transfers<br><br>As our business develops, we may sell, transfer, reorganize, or acquire business assets.<br><br>In connection with a merger, acquisition, financing, reorganization, sale of assets, or similar transaction, personal information may be transferred as part of the relevant business assets, subject to applicable law.<br><br>11. Legal Disclosures<br><br>We may disclose information when we reasonably believe that doing so is necessary to:<br><br>* Comply with applicable law, regulation, legal process, or governmental request<br>* Protect our rights or property<br>* Protect the safety of our users, customers, employees, or others<br>* Investigate fraud, abuse, or security concerns<br>* Enforce our agreements or policies<br><br>12. Data Security<br><br>We take reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational measures designed to protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.<br><br>However, no method of transmitting or storing information online can be guaranteed to be completely secure. Therefore, we cannot guarantee absolute security of information transmitted to or through the Site.<br><br>13. Data Retention<br><br>We retain personal information for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, provide our services, maintain business and transaction records, resolve disputes, enforce agreements, and comply with applicable legal obligations.<br><br>The specific retention period may vary depending on the nature of the information and the reason it was collected.<br><br>14. Your Privacy Choices<br><br>Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have certain rights concerning your personal information.<br><br>These may include the right to:<br><br>* Request access to personal information we maintain about you<br>* Request correction of inaccurate information<br>* Request deletion of certain information<br>* Request a copy or portability of certain information<br>* Object to or restrict certain processing<br>* Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent<br>* Opt out of certain marketing communications<br>* Exercise applicable rights concerning targeted advertising or the sale/sharing of personal information<br><br>To make a privacy-related request, please contact us using the information provided at the end of this Privacy Policy.<br><br>We may need to verify your identity before completing certain requests, as permitted or required by applicable law.<br><br>15. European Privacy Rights<br><br>If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom, or another jurisdiction where similar data-protection rights apply, you may have additional rights regarding your personal information.<br><br>Depending on the circumstances and applicable law, these rights may include access, correction, deletion, data portability, restriction of processing, objection to processing, and withdrawal of consent.<br><br>To submit a privacy request, contact us at:<br><br>Email: [support@Prostavive.org](mailto:support@Prostavive.org)<br><br>If you believe your privacy rights have been violated, you may also have the right to contact your applicable data-protection authority.<br><br>16. California Privacy Rights<br><br>California residents may have additional privacy rights under applicable California privacy laws.<br><br>Depending on applicable legal requirements, these rights may include requesting information about the categories of personal information collected, requesting access to or deletion of certain personal information, correcting certain information, and opting out of certain forms of sale, sharing, or targeted advertising.<br><br>To submit a California privacy request, contact:<br><br>Email: [support@Prostavive.org](mailto:support@Prostavive.org)<br><br>We will process requests in accordance with applicable California law.<br><br>17. Children's Privacy<br><br>The Site is not directed toward children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.<br><br>If we learn that we have unintentionally collected personal information from a child under 13, we will take reasonable steps to delete that information from our records.<br><br>If you believe that a child under 13 has provided personal information through the Site, please contact us at:<br><br>Email: [support@Prostavive.org](mailto:support@Prostavive.org)<br><br>18. Email Communications<br><br>If you voluntarily subscribe to receive emails from us, our communications may include an unsubscribe option.<br><br>You may opt out of promotional emails at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link included in the applicable communication.<br><br>Please note that you may continue to receive certain non-promotional communications, such as transactional or service-related messages, when necessary to complete an order or respond to a request.<br><br>19. Changes to This Privacy Policy<br><br>We may modify this Privacy Policy at any time.<br><br>When changes are made, we will update the Effective Date at the beginning of this policy and post the revised version on the Site.<br><br>We encourage you to periodically review this Privacy Policy to remain informed about how we handle information.<br><br>20. Contact Us<br><br>If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us:<br><br>ProstaVive<br>Email: support@Prostavive.org (mailto:support@Prostavive.org)<br><br>We will make reasonable efforts to respond to privacy inquiries in accordance with applicable law.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
