          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>\n                    Terms and Conditions</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Acceptance of the Terms of Use<br><br>These Terms of Use are entered into between you and ProstaVive (“Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”). These Terms of Use, together with any documents expressly incorporated by reference, govern your access to and use of the ProstaVive website, including its content, features, functionality, products, services, and resources (collectively, the “Website”).<br><br>Please read these Terms of Use carefully before using the Website. By accessing or using the Website, or by clicking to accept these Terms when that option is provided, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and our Privacy Policy, available at https://prostavive.org/privacy-policy, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference.<br><br>If you do not agree with these Terms of Use or our Privacy Policy, you should not access or use the Website.<br><br>The Website is intended for individuals who are at least 18 years of age. By using the Website, you represent that you are at least 18 years old and legally capable of entering into a binding agreement. If you do not meet these requirements, you must not access or use the Website.<br><br>Changes to These Terms<br><br>We may revise or update these Terms of Use from time to time at our discretion. Any changes will become effective when the revised Terms are posted on the Website, unless otherwise stated.<br><br>Your continued use of the Website after revised Terms are posted constitutes your acceptance of those changes. We encourage you to review these Terms periodically so that you remain aware of any updates.<br><br>Accessing the Website<br><br>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, restrict, or discontinue any portion of the Website, including any content, products, services, or features, at any time and without prior notice.<br><br>We do not guarantee that the Website or any portion of it will always be available, uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.<br><br>You are responsible for making all arrangements necessary to access the Website and for ensuring that anyone using the Website through your internet connection complies with these Terms of Use.<br><br>Account and Security<br><br>Certain features of the Website may require you to provide registration information or create an account.<br><br>You agree that all information you provide to us must be accurate, complete, and current. You are responsible for maintaining the accuracy of your information and for updating it when necessary.<br><br>If you create an account, you are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your username, password, and other account credentials. You must not share your login information with another person.<br><br>You agree to notify us promptly if you become aware of unauthorized access to your account or any other security issue involving your account.<br><br>You are responsible for all activity that occurs through your account unless such activity results from circumstances outside your reasonable control.<br><br>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate usernames, passwords, or accounts at our discretion if we believe that these Terms have been violated or if doing so is necessary to protect the Website, our users, or our business.<br><br>Intellectual Property Rights<br><br>The Website and all of its content, features, functionality, design, text, graphics, images, photographs, videos, audio, software, trademarks, logos, and other materials are owned by ProstaVive or its licensors and are protected by applicable copyright, trademark, intellectual-property, and other laws.<br><br>These Terms permit you to access and use the Website for your personal, non-commercial purposes.<br><br>Except as expressly permitted by these Terms or applicable law, you may not:<br><br>* Reproduce, copy, modify, or create derivative works from Website content<br>* Distribute, publish, sell, or otherwise commercially exploit Website content<br>* Publicly display or perform Website content without permission<br>* Remove copyright, trademark, or other proprietary notices<br>* Use Website content to create competing products or services<br>* Download or reproduce substantial portions of the Website for redistribution<br>* Use automated systems to copy or collect Website content without written permission<br><br>You may temporarily store Website materials in your device's memory as part of normal Website use.<br><br>You may also print or download a reasonable number of pages for your own personal, non-commercial use, provided that you do not reproduce, distribute, modify, or commercially exploit those materials.<br><br>No ownership rights in the Website or its content are transferred to you. All rights not expressly granted under these Terms are reserved by ProstaVive and its licensors.<br><br>Trademarks<br><br>The ProstaVive name, logo, product names, service names, designs, slogans, and other related marks may be trademarks of ProstaVive or its affiliates, licensors, or partners.<br><br>You may not use these trademarks without prior written permission from the applicable trademark owner.<br><br>All other trademarks, product names, company names, and logos appearing on the Website belong to their respective owners.<br><br>Prohibited Uses<br><br>You may use the Website only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms.<br><br>You agree not to use the Website:<br><br>* In violation of any applicable federal, state, local, or international law or regulation<br>* To impersonate ProstaVive, an employee, representative, another user, or another person or organization<br>* To transmit spam, unsolicited advertising, chain letters, or other unauthorized promotional material<br>* To introduce viruses, malware, worms, Trojan horses, or other harmful code<br>* To interfere with the proper operation or security of the Website<br>* To attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Website, servers, databases, or related systems<br>* To collect information about other users without authorization<br>* To engage in activity that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair the Website<br>* To use the Website for fraudulent, deceptive, or unlawful purposes<br>* To use the Website to violate another person's intellectual-property, privacy, or other legal rights<br><br>You also may not use robots, spiders, crawlers, scraping tools, or other automated methods to access, copy, monitor, or collect Website content without our prior written permission.<br><br>Reliance on Information Posted<br><br>The information provided on or through the Website is intended for general informational and educational purposes.<br><br>Although we make reasonable efforts to provide useful and accurate information, we do not guarantee that Website content is complete, accurate, current, reliable, or error-free.<br><br>Your reliance on information provided through the Website is at your own discretion and risk.<br><br>The Website may contain information provided by third parties. Opinions, statements, articles, or other materials provided by third parties belong to their respective authors and do not necessarily represent the views of ProstaVive.<br><br>We are not responsible for the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of third-party content.<br><br>Changes to the Website<br><br>We may update, modify, remove, or replace Website content at any time.<br><br>We do not guarantee that all information on the Website will remain current or that previously published content will be updated.<br><br>Information About You<br><br>All information collected through the Website is handled in accordance with our Privacy Policy.<br><br>By using the Website, you acknowledge that you have reviewed our Privacy Policy and agree to the collection and use of information as described in that policy.<br><br>Online Purchases<br><br>Purchases made through the Website or transactions involving ProstaVive products may be subject to additional terms, conditions, refund policies, and payment-processing terms.<br><br>Where applicable, those terms are incorporated into these Terms of Use by reference.<br><br>Additional terms may also apply to particular products, services, promotions, or features offered through the Website.<br><br>Third-Party Websites and Links<br><br>The Website may contain links to third-party websites, services, advertisements, or resources.<br><br>These links are provided for convenience and informational purposes. ProstaVive does not control or endorse third-party websites and is not responsible for their content, availability, privacy practices, security, products, or services.<br><br>If you choose to access a third-party website, you do so at your own risk and are subject to that third party's terms and privacy policy.<br><br>Electronic Communications<br><br>When you provide your email address, you may receive electronic communications related to your orders, account, customer service requests, or other transactions.<br><br>Where permitted by applicable law and where you have provided appropriate consent, you may also receive promotional communications, newsletters, special offers, product updates, or other marketing communications.<br><br>You may unsubscribe from promotional communications at any time by following the unsubscribe instructions included in the applicable communication.<br><br>Unsubscribing from promotional communications will not necessarily prevent us from sending important transactional or service-related communications.<br><br>Geographic Restrictions<br><br>The Website and its products and services may be intended primarily for users located in the United States.<br><br>If you access the Website from outside the United States, you are responsible for determining whether your use of the Website and any products or services available through it complies with applicable local laws.<br><br>ProstaVive does not represent that the Website or its content is appropriate or available for use in every jurisdiction.<br><br>Health Disclaimer<br><br>ProstaVive products and the health-related information provided on the Website are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition.<br><br>The information provided on the Website is for general educational and informational purposes and is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.<br><br>You should consult a qualified physician or other licensed healthcare professional before using ProstaVive or starting any dietary supplement, exercise, diet, or wellness program.<br><br>This is particularly important if you have an existing medical condition, take prescription or over-the-counter medications, are pregnant or nursing, or have questions or concerns about your health.<br><br>Do not disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking medical advice because of information provided on the Website.<br><br>Individual results may vary. No specific health outcome or result is guaranteed.<br><br>ProstaVive and the Website are not intended to replace professional healthcare services.<br><br>Disclaimer of Warranties<br><br>Your use of the Website is at your own risk.<br><br>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Website and its content, services, products, and materials are provided on an “AS IS” and “AS AVAILABLE” basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.<br><br>To the fullest extent permitted by law, ProstaVive disclaims warranties including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, accuracy, availability, and reliability.<br><br>We do not warrant that:<br><br>* The Website will always be available or uninterrupted<br>* The Website will be secure or error-free<br>* Website content will always be accurate or current<br>* Defects or errors will always be corrected<br>* The Website or its servers will be free of viruses or other harmful components<br>* Products, services, or information obtained through the Website will meet your individual requirements or expectations<br><br>You are responsible for maintaining appropriate security measures on your devices, including appropriate antivirus and malware protection.<br><br>Some jurisdictions do not allow certain warranty exclusions, so some of these limitations may not apply to you.<br><br>Limitation of Liability<br><br>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, ProstaVive, its affiliates, licensors, service providers, employees, agents, officers, directors, and representatives will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages arising from or related to your use of, or inability to use, the Website or any products, services, content, or materials obtained through the Website.<br><br>This limitation may include, where permitted by law, loss of revenue, profits, business opportunities, data, goodwill, or other intangible losses.<br><br>ProstaVive is also not responsible for unauthorized or fraudulent communications sent by third parties who falsely claim to represent ProstaVive.<br><br>Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded or limited under applicable law.<br><br>Indemnification<br><br>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, you agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless ProstaVive, its affiliates, licensors, service providers, employees, agents, officers, directors, contractors, and representatives from claims, liabilities, damages, losses, judgments, costs, and expenses, including reasonable attorneys' fees, arising from or related to:<br><br>* Your violation of these Terms<br>* Your misuse of the Website<br>* Your violation of applicable law<br>* Your violation of another person's rights<br>* Your unauthorized use of Website content<br>* Your use of products or services in a manner inconsistent with applicable instructions or these Terms<br><br>Governing Law and Jurisdiction<br><br>These Terms of Use and your use of the Website will be governed by applicable law, without regard to conflict-of-law principles, except where otherwise required by applicable law.<br><br>Any dispute arising from or relating to these Terms or the Website will be handled in a court or other forum with appropriate jurisdiction, unless the parties agree to another legally permissible method of dispute resolution.<br><br>Arbitration<br><br>Where permitted by applicable law, ProstaVive may require certain disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Website to be resolved through binding arbitration rather than through court proceedings.<br><br>Any applicable arbitration will be conducted in accordance with the arbitration rules and procedures agreed upon by the parties or otherwise required by applicable law.<br><br>Class Action Waiver<br><br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, disputes subject to arbitration must be brought on an individual basis rather than as part of a class, collective, or representative action.<br><br>Nothing in this provision limits rights that cannot legally be waived.<br><br>Limitation on Time to File Claims<br><br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, any claim or cause of action arising from or relating to these Terms or the Website must be brought within the period permitted by applicable law.<br><br>Nothing in this section is intended to limit a legally required statute of limitations or other non-waivable legal right.<br><br>Waiver and Severability<br><br>If we fail to enforce any provision of these Terms, that failure will not constitute a waiver of our right to enforce that provision in the future.<br><br>If any provision of these Terms is determined to be invalid, unlawful, or unenforceable, that provision will be limited or removed to the minimum extent necessary, while the remaining provisions will remain in full force and effect.<br><br>Entire Agreement<br><br>These Terms of Use, together with the Privacy Policy and any applicable Terms of Sale or other policies expressly incorporated by reference, constitute the entire agreement between you and ProstaVive concerning your use of the Website.<br><br>They supersede prior agreements, understandings, representations, and communications concerning the subject matter covered by these Terms, except where otherwise expressly stated.<br><br>Feedback<br><br>If you voluntarily provide comments, suggestions, ideas, reviews, or other feedback regarding ProstaVive or the Website, you understand that such feedback may be used by ProstaVive without creating an obligation to compensate you.<br><br>You represent that you have the right to provide any feedback you submit and that doing so does not violate the rights of another person or organization.<br><br>Termination<br><br>We may suspend or terminate your access to all or part of the Website at any time if we believe that you have violated these Terms, applicable law, or our policies, or if termination is otherwise necessary to protect the Website, our users, or our business.<br><br>Upon termination, provisions of these Terms that by their nature should survive termination will continue to apply.<br><br>Contact Information<br><br>If you have questions, concerns, comments, or requests regarding these Terms of Use or the Website, please contact us at:<br><br><b>ProstaVive</b><br><br>Email: support@prostavive.org (mailto:support@prostavive.org)<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
