          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>\n                    Disclaimer</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Disclaimer<br><br>The information provided on ProstaVive.org, including its website, guides, articles, publications, and other resources, is provided for general informational and educational purposes only. By using this website or any information made available through it, you acknowledge and agree that you are responsible for your own decisions and actions.<br><br>The information presented on this website is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition. Nothing on this website should be considered a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.<br><br>Always consult with a qualified physician or other licensed healthcare professional before starting any dietary, exercise, or supplementation program, or before making changes to any medication or treatment. This is especially important if you have an existing medical condition, take prescription or over-the-counter medications, are pregnant or nursing, or have any concerns about your health.<br><br>ProstaVive and its related products, services, publications, and content are intended for adults aged 18 and older. Individuals under the age of 18 should not use or purchase our products or services without appropriate parental or guardian supervision and permission.<br><br>Although we make reasonable efforts to provide accurate and current information, we do not guarantee that all information presented on ProstaVive.org is complete, accurate, reliable, current, or error-free. Information may contain typographical errors, omissions, outdated material, or other inaccuracies. We reserve the right to update, modify, or remove content at any time without prior notice.<br><br>Any information, recommendations, statements, or opinions provided through this website are offered on an “as is” and “as available” basis, without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, to the fullest extent permitted by applicable law.<br><br>Individual results from dietary supplements, lifestyle changes, or other products and practices may vary. No particular result or outcome is guaranteed. Testimonials, examples, or other statements regarding potential results should not be interpreted as a promise or representation of typical results.<br><br>You assume full responsibility for your use of the information provided on this website. ProstaVive, its owners, operators, authors, publishers, affiliates, partners, service providers, and related parties shall not be responsible, to the fullest extent permitted by law, for any loss, damage, injury, expense, or other consequence arising from or related to your use or misuse of information, products, services, or resources made available through the website.<br><br>Nothing contained on this website creates a doctor-patient relationship, professional healthcare relationship, or other advisory relationship between you and ProstaVive or any person associated with ProstaVive.<br><br>The website may contain links to third-party websites, products, services, or resources. ProstaVive does not control or guarantee the accuracy, availability, security, or content of third-party websites. Your use of third-party websites and services is subject to their respective terms and privacy policies.<br><br>Certain materials or resources made available through the website may require third-party software or applications to access or display them. You are responsible for obtaining and maintaining any software or equipment necessary to access such materials. Any downloads or files obtained through the website or third-party websites are accessed at your own discretion and risk. We do not guarantee that downloaded files or third-party resources will be free from viruses, malware, worms, or other potentially harmful components.<br><br>By using this website or any information or resources provided by ProstaVive, you agree, to the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, to release and hold harmless ProstaVive, its owners, operators, authors, publishers, affiliates, partners, and service providers from claims, liabilities, losses, damages, costs, or expenses arising from your use of the website, information, products, or services, except where such limitation is prohibited by law.<br><br>The content and information provided on ProstaVive.org represent general educational material and may reflect the opinions or perspectives of the respective authors or contributors. You should conduct your own research and consult qualified professionals before making decisions based on information presented on this website.<br><br>By continuing to access or use ProstaVive.org, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to this Disclaimer.<br><br>Other Products : <a href=\"https://www.thergeniuswave.com/\" class=\"text-primary\">The Genius Wave</a> | <a href=\"https://www.neuroprimeusa.com/\" class=\"text-primary\">NeuroPrime</a> | <a href=\"https://www.us-en-dentalbiome.com/\" class=\"text-primary\">DentalBiome</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://us-prodentim.vercel.app/\" class=\"text-primary\">Prodentim</a></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
